---
// Neofetch Component
---

<div class="neofetch-display">
  <div class="ascii-art">
    <pre class="ascii-logo">
       ╔═══════════════════════════════════════╗
       ║                                       ║
       ║   ██████╗ ██████╗                     ║
       ║  ██╔════╝ ██╔══██╗                    ║
       ║  ██║      ██████╔╝                    ║
       ║  ██║      ██╔══██╗                    ║
       ║  ╚██████╗ ██║  ██║                    ║
       ║   ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝                    ║
       ║                                       ║
       ║  ┌─┐┌─┐┌┐┌┌┐┌┌─┐┬─┐                   ║
       ║  │  │ │││││││├┤ ├┬┘                   ║
       ║  └─┘└─┘┘└┘┘└┘└─┘┴└─                   ║
       ║                                       ║
       ║  ┬─┐┌─┐┌─┐┬  ┌─┐┌─┐┬  ┌─┐             ║
       ║  ├┬┘├┤ ├─┘│  │ ││ ┬│  ├┤              ║
       ║  ┴└─└─┘┴  ┴─┘└─┘└─┘┴─┘└─┘             ║
       ║                                       ║
       ╚═══════════════════════════════════════╝
    </pre>
  </div>

  <div class="system-info">
    <slot></slot>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .neofetch-display {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .ascii-art {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ascii-logo {
    color: #ff00ff;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff00ff 0%, #00ffff 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .system-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
   /* Mobile responsiveness */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .neofetch-display {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    
    .ascii-logo {
      font-size: 7px;
    }
    
    .key {
      min-width: 100px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    
    .value {
      font-size: 12px;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
    
    .terminal-body {
      padding: 15px;
    }

    .terminal-header {
      padding: 10px 12px;
    }

    .terminal-title {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .info-line {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ascii-logo {
      font-size: 5px;
    }
    
    .key {
      min-width: 80px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    
    .value {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
  }
</style>
